Sunshine Toolbox
================

This project is a derivative work of Garuda Toolbox:

  Upstream:  https://gitlab.com/garuda-linux/applications/toolbox
  Upstream authors: Garuda Linux contributors
  Upstream license: GPL-3.0-or-later

The upstream source was forked, renamed, and adapted for Sunshine OS. Changes include:
  - Rebranding of all text, icons, themes and desktop/polkit metadata to Sunshine OS
  - Replacement of @garudalinux/core and @garudalinux/themes with local Sunshine modules
  - Rewiring of all system commands to the sunshine-* command suite
  - Sunshine OS palette, logo, launcher and packaging

